Pi Knowledge Triage Compactor

The knowledge classification, retention and retrieval implementation is adapted
from Knowledge Triage, Copyright 2026 The Knowledge Triage Authors, licensed
under Apache-2.0. Reference revision: a6ceb01a.
https://github.com/searchsim-org/cikm26-knowledge-triage

This distribution modifies that implementation for Pi session archives,
incremental extraction, local classification, bounded retrieval, and standalone
extension packaging. Additional changes are described in CHANGELOG.md.

Local classification uses Laya 0.3.27 (Apache-2.0):
https://github.com/NandhaKishorM/laya
Model: convaiinnovations/laya-multilingual (Apache-2.0), revision
1720e3e3357cfe1e281542e223f8273b0890ca34.
Laya, model weights, uv and Python are downloaded separately during setup;
they are not bundled in the npm package. Their upstream licenses apply.
